- U | offer to rebuild their whole system from scratch, on a staff developer's contract | v: achievement, self-direction | act: offer to rebuild the whole system from scratch on a staff developer's contract | chance: 30 | requires: writing code | title: software developer | title_if_fails: out of work
works: {N} rebuilds the system in four months, and the firm keeps {N} on as its software developer.
works: The new system runs from the first morning, and {N} has a developer's desk and a developer's title.
fails: The rebuild runs late and breaks on launch day, the contract is ended, and {N} is out of work again.
fails: Halfway through, the firm pulls the plug on the rebuild, and {N} walks out with the box a second time, out of work.

