# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the cyclist at dusk

== bold: the cyclist at dusk / B
base: say nothing, and stop driving after dark, so nobody need ever know
likelier_if: years [driving licence] 40 +10; has [savings] +5
- B | swap the car for a camper van, and drive it your own way, by daylight | v: self-direction, power | act: swap the car for a camper van and drive it their own way, by daylight | chance: 35 | grants: camper van | takes_if_fails: driving licence
works: {N} drives the new camper van out of the yard in the morning sun, and the road is still {Ns}.
works: The camper van takes {N} along the coast all summer, never once after dark, and nobody takes the keys.
fails: Within weeks {N} misjudges a turn in the rain, the doctor is told, and the licence is taken away.
fails: A second fright at a crossing ends it: the eye test is failed, and the licence is taken.

