- W | promise the hospital a year on the front desk, and keep it through every check-up | v: conformity, benevolence | act: promise the hospital a year on the front desk and keep it through every check-up | chance: 30 | title: receptionist | title_if_fails: out of work
works: {N} keeps the promise, and by the year's end is the hospital's own receptionist, on a proper contract.
works: Patients come to know {Ns} face at the front desk, and the post becomes {Ns} for good.
fails: The check-ups and the tiredness eat the shifts, the post goes to someone else, and {N} signs on as out of work.
fails: {N} cannot keep the hours, the hospital lets the post go, and {N} is formally out of work.
